# Local Engineering Rules

## Slice Discipline
- Build squad features in vertical slices.
- Keep the first slice limited to static squad boot with one visible squad leader.
- Do not implement transient spawning, status telemetry, or daemon behavior unless the current task explicitly asks for that slice.

## Verification
- Run the relevant local verification command before handoff whenever the project has one.
- For this repository, `bb test` is the normal helper test command.
